OL,3,GNEWSAGas engineer warns of illegal
OL,4,Ameter bypass requests
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas engineer says he has received
OL,7,Fcalls asking him to illegally bypass
OL,8,Fmeters so people can avoid paying
OL,9,Fbills.
OL,11,FTom Dix, from Faringdon in Oxfordshire,
OL,12,Fsaid in the last year he had received
OL,13,Fbetween 20 and 30 requests to either
OL,14,Fremove a meter completely or run pipes
OL,15,Faround it to get free gas.
OL,17,FHe said: "It's a completely illegal and
OL,18,Fdangerous thing to do. It's like an act
OL,19,Fof desperation now and it's very
OL,20,Fdangerous."
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
