OL,3,GNEWSAGas engineer warns of illegal
OL,4,Ameter bypass requests
OL,5,
OL,6,FStay Energy Safe, run by Crimestoppers,
OL,7,Fsaid there had been more than 21,000
OL,8,Fcases of energy theft across the UK in
OL,9,F2025-26, a 23% increase on the past
OL,10,Ffive years.
